// Benchmark 8 (`docs/rfc.md` §7.8): Unknown beneficial-owner fact, conflicting filings, and adjudicated `Finding`.
//! explore: 1
Fact officer Identified by Off1.
Fact tribunal Identified by Trib1.
Fact account Identified by Acc9.
Fact person Identified by Ubo1.
Fact tribunal-quorum Identified by tribunal.
Evidenced Fact verified-ubo Identified by account
  Confidential To auditor, tribunal.
Fact transfer-cleared Identified by account.

Power clear-transfer Actor officer Related to account
  Holds when verified-ubo(account)
  Valid when verified-ubo(account)
  Creates transfer-cleared(account).

Finding rule-ubo Actor tribunal Related to account
  Resolves verified-ubo(account)
  Standard clear-and-convincing
  Holds when Conflicted(verified-ubo(account)) || Unresolved(verified-ubo(account))
  Valid when tribunal-quorum(tribunal).

Invariant cleared-requires-established-ubo When (Forall account: Established(verified-ubo(account)) When transfer-cleared(account)).

Scenario unresolved-to-conflicted-to-adjudicated-finding {
  ?Unresolved(verified-ubo(Acc9)).
  ?undetermined clear-transfer(Off1, Acc9).
  SubmitEvidence verified-ubo(Acc9) By "registry-A".
  SubmitEvidence !verified-ubo(Acc9) By "whistleblower-B".
  ?Conflicted(verified-ubo(Acc9)).
  ?!valid clear-transfer(Off1, Acc9).
  +tribunal-quorum(Trib1).
  rule-ubo(Trib1, Acc9).
  ?Established(verified-ubo(Acc9)).
  clear-transfer(Off1, Acc9).
  ?transfer-cleared(Acc9).
}
